A below-column marker after a comment, where no paragraph is open

```
- a
  %%%
  x
  %%%
 - s
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    - s
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  %%%
  x
  %%%
 1. o
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    1. o
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  %%%
  x
  %%%
 # h
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    # h
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  b
 - s
.
<ul>
  <li>a
b
- s</li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  > q
 - s
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <blockquote><p>q
- s</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```
